{
  "name": "Zephyr Defense",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you are hit by an attack, you can use your Reaction to make a Dexterity (Acrobatics) check and subtract the result of the roll from the damage taken.</p><p>You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Dexterity modifier and you can regain all expended uses when you finish a Short or a Long Rest. You can also spend a use of your Second Wind to regain a use of this feature (no action required).</p>",
